  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole mature hadrosaur with low broad transverse crest and deep blunt bill; no nest or juvenile substitution.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Living reconstruction, not a fossil scan. Nine metres is an NHM taxon estimate, not measured length of the illustrated individuals. Museum mount combines preserved and restored anatomy; tissue, colour and posture are interpretative. Adult cranial reconstruction uses ROM66180, not subadult crest absence.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，不是化石扫描。9米为博物馆物种级估值，不是图示个体的实测长度。装架包含复原部分，软组织、颜色与姿态属推断。成体头冠参考ROM66180，不以亚成体缺冠代表成体。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":377,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Maiasaura\",\"zh\":\"慈母龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Maiasaura peeblesorum\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda, Hadrosauridae\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":9.0,\"basis\":\"NHM Dino Directory estimate; no scale transfer between museum mounts and ROM cranium.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Low wide transverse solid crest over the eyes, slightly forward-facing concave dish, not a narrow sagittal blade or two separate horns.\",\"Broad blunt spoon-like bill and deep jaw; head retains long face and distinct orbit region.\",\"Deep robust trunk, neck, four limbs and long tapering tail retained; quadrupedal neutral stance with smaller forelimbs and elevated balancing tail.\",\"Mature crest chosen from ROM66180 reference; do not substitute crestless juvenile or tall Corythosaurus helmet.\",\"No sail, nose balloon, armour or exaggerated head spike; uncertain skin represented simply.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"ROM66180 anterior/anterodorsal cranium Fig4 McFeeters etal2021 supports adult crest; MOR adult skull photograph supports bill. Wyoming Dinosaur Center mounted whole skeleton supports body anatomy; no unverified accession identity asserted.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole mature hadrosaur with low broad transverse crest and deep blunt bill; no nest or juvenile substitution.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Living reconstruction, not a fossil scan. Nine metres is an NHM taxon estimate, not measured length of the illustrated individuals. Museum mount combines preserved and restored anatomy; tissue, colour and posture are interpretative. Adult cranial reconstruction uses ROM66180, not subadult crest absence.\",\"zh\":\"完整活体复原，不是化石扫描。9米为博物馆物种级估值，不是图示个体的实测长度。装架包含复原部分，软组织、颜色与姿态属推断。成体头冠参考ROM66180，不以亚成体缺冠代表成体。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":377,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Maiasaura\",\"zh\":\"慈母龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Maiasaura peeblesorum\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda, Hadrosauridae\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":9.0,\"basis\":\"NHM Dino Directory estimate; no scale transfer between museum mounts and ROM cranium.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Low wide transverse solid crest over the eyes, slightly forward-facing concave dish, not a narrow sagittal blade or two separate horns.\",\"Broad blunt spoon-like bill and deep jaw; head retains long face and distinct orbit region.\",\"Deep robust trunk, neck, four limbs and long tapering tail retained; quadrupedal neutral stance with smaller forelimbs and elevated balancing tail.\",\"Mature crest chosen from ROM66180 reference; do not substitute crestless juvenile or tall Corythosaurus helmet.\",\"No sail, nose balloon, armour or exaggerated head spike; uncertain skin represented simply.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"ROM66180 anterior/anterodorsal cranium Fig4 McFeeters etal2021 supports adult crest; MOR adult skull photograph supports bill. Wyoming Dinosaur Center mounted whole skeleton supports body anatomy; no unverified accession identity asserted.\"}"
  },
